claim.claim-text:
a body defining an aperture;
an electrode comprising a portion within the aperture; and
a lead; and
a heating element connected to the lead;
a porous member for use in holding aerosolisable material to be atomised using the heating element, wherein the porous member comprises a recess defining a basin for holding the aerosolisable material;
wherein the heating element is located on a surface of the porous member, wherein the surface is located an opposite side of the porous member to that of the basin;
wherein the lead is operable to transfer power between the electrode and the heating element.
